1
00:00:00,06 --> 00:00:02,04
- [Instructor] This class is for an intermediate

2
00:00:02,04 --> 00:00:03,06
to advanced level.

3
00:00:03,06 --> 00:00:05,07
And in order to get the most out of this course,

4
00:00:05,07 --> 00:00:07,00
you should know about the basics

5
00:00:07,00 --> 00:00:10,08
of web development, such as HTML to create webpages,

6
00:00:10,08 --> 00:00:12,02
and you should also understand

7
00:00:12,02 --> 00:00:14,03
how to change the appearance of a webpage

8
00:00:14,03 --> 00:00:15,08
by using the CSS rules.

9
00:00:15,08 --> 00:00:18,08
And some knowledge of JavaScript and ES6

10
00:00:18,08 --> 00:00:21,00
will be useful as well.

11
00:00:21,00 --> 00:00:22,02
A basic understanding

12
00:00:22,02 --> 00:00:24,06
of React development is highly recommended,

13
00:00:24,06 --> 00:00:25,06
meaning that you should know

14
00:00:25,06 --> 00:00:27,03
how to create a React component,

15
00:00:27,03 --> 00:00:29,03
how to pass data down to child components

16
00:00:29,03 --> 00:00:31,09
by using the props, how to create interactions,

17
00:00:31,09 --> 00:00:34,02
and also understand how to use the hooks,

18
00:00:34,02 --> 00:00:38,00
which have been available since the version 16.8 of React,

19
00:00:38,00 --> 00:00:42,01
in order to create functional and stateful components.

20
00:00:42,01 --> 00:00:47,01
It will also be helpful to have some experience

21
00:00:47,01 --> 00:00:49,08
and to know one package manager like npm

22
00:00:49,08 --> 00:00:51,02
in order to run scripts.

23
00:00:51,02 --> 00:00:52,01
So what you should know

24
00:00:52,01 --> 00:00:54,07
is how to change directory by running cd,

25
00:00:54,07 --> 00:00:57,04
and also display the list of files and folders

26
00:00:57,04 --> 00:00:59,09
included in a directory with ls.

27
00:00:59,09 --> 00:01:02,04
And finally, you can run npm start

28
00:01:02,04 --> 00:01:06,00
in order to start a project created with Create React app.

29
00:01:06,00 --> 00:01:08,06
So if you have answered yes to every technical requirements,

30
00:01:08,06 --> 00:01:09,05
this is perfect.

31
00:01:09,05 --> 00:01:12,00
You are all set and ready to enjoy the class.

